     "notes": {
      "text": "Ng5! attacks the pinned rook a second time. It cannot move, and Black has no good way to defend it again, so Black will lose the rook. Taking on f7 at once only wins the exchange and leaves a close game. If you see a good move, look for a better one.",
      "credit": {
       "source": "Wikibooks, Chess/Tactics",
